：次序","readings":[{"term":"순서","audio":"/audio/ef711cfc76747ee60b55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64563","senseId":"2","lemma":"순서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"순서","audio":"/audio/ef711cfc76747ee60b55.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤집히면","meaning":"被颠倒，被颠覆","explanation":"뒤집히다：被颠倒，被颠覆；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"뒤집히다","audio":"/audio/dbdc2f4fe9359c482415.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66946","senseId":"3","lemma":"뒤집히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤집히면","audio":"/audio/163d74f33f6e4c3d1109.mp3"}},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때요","audio":"/audio/6dbf157a4dc7e6e8b537.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ef711cfc76747ee6","term":"순서","zh":"次序","audio":"/audio/ef711cfc76747ee60b55.mp3","entryId":"64563","definition":"做某事或某事实现的顺序。","pronunciation":["순ː서"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"dbdc2f4fe9359c48","term":"뒤집히다","zh":"被颠倒，被颠覆","audio":"/audio/dbdc2f4fe9359c482415.mp3","entryId":"66946","definition":"事情的顺序或胜负结果被改变。","pronunciation":["뒤지피다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4ee382ace54cd5a4670c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.79,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSe